# ACD

- Use `acd <stage>` (or `npx acd <stage>`) as the control plane.
- Canonical skills: `acd/skills/`. Agent rules: `acd/agents/`.
- Do not mark specs approved; HitL is configuration.
- While the pipeline is red, only `acd fix`.
